<title>POLAND: Universal launches PLN 55 mln CP scheme.</title>
<headline>Universal launches PLN 55 mln CP scheme.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish trading company Universal SA has launched a 55-million zloty commercial paper programme, issuing the first tranche of 20 million zlotys, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the issue was managed by Polish state-owned bank Pekao SA.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
